# Core hours

Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-ac340d00aa568bb7393e4ba8b8f98afe8c8b7e5f "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]]. Where the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies. The staff handbook states core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days[[cite:obs-43e04700f165a30e5870a60b8fbf2b8dafe85aad "Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days."]].